Learn the best practices for AWS Cost Management.

- [Logging AWS Cost Management API calls with AWS CloudTrail](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cost-management/latest/userguide/logging-with-cloudtrail.md): Learn the best practices for logging AWS Cost Management API calls with AWS CloudTrail.
